state Ticket Workflow
// stress: long-labels — transition labels of 20 to 40 characters between close states

[*] -> Open

Open
  -assigned to the on-call engineer-> Triaged
  -closed as a duplicate of another-> Closed

Triaged
  -reproduced on the staging cluster-> Fixing
  -needs more information from customer-> Waiting

Waiting
  -customer replied with the logs-> Triaged

Fixing
  -patch merged and deployed to prod-> Resolved

Resolved
  -customer confirmed the fix works-> Closed
  -regression found within a week-> Open

Closed -> [*]
